{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01327",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.71,
      "end_seconds": 4.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.15,
      "end_seconds": 9.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.93,
      "end_seconds": 16.56,
      "duration_seconds": 5.63,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a cough that won't go away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.51,
      "end_seconds": 21.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.34,
      "end_seconds": 26.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Okay, so ever since... since Monday, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.92,
      "end_seconds": 31.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "How much trouble does it give you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.46,
      "end_seconds": 33.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "Mostly mild."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.06,
      "end_seconds": 41.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.0,
      "end_seconds": 44.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "It's all the time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.14,
      "end_seconds": 50.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Has there been a tight chest in the morning too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.52,
      "end_seconds": 53.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Yes, since this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.33,
      "end_seconds": 66.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "So, has there been any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.55,
      "end_seconds": 69.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "No fever, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.93,
      "end_seconds": 76.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.94,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weight loss, leg swelling or night sweats?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.82,
      "end_seconds": 83.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Um, no, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.77,
      "end_seconds": 86.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.7,
      "end_seconds": 89.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.36,
      "end_seconds": 109.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.54,
      "text": "Alright, any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.81,
      "end_seconds": 120.43,
      "duration_seconds": 9.62,
      "text": "I had a reaction to amoxicillin when I was younger, a rash all over, and I've avoided it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.09,
      "end_seconds": 138.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "So, is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.45,
      "end_seconds": 148.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.76,
      "text": "Let me think, no, I'm not on anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.41,
      "end_seconds": 152.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Are there any illnesses in your family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.35,
      "end_seconds": 157.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "My father had bowel cancer."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.96,
      "end_seconds": 160.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.12,
      "end_seconds": 162.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Yes, acid reflux."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.5,
      "end_seconds": 166.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.2,
      "end_seconds": 171.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.67,
      "end_seconds": 174.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.28,
      "end_seconds": 178.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.9,
      "end_seconds": 182.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.4,
      "end_seconds": 187.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.88,
      "end_seconds": 204.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Let me take your readings now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.35,
      "end_seconds": 216.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.67,
      "end_seconds": 237.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 82 beats a minute, respiratory rate 14. And oxygen saturation is 98 percent, blood pressure 114 over 80, temperature 36.7."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.85,
      "end_seconds": 243.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.53,
      "end_seconds": 248.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.61,
      "end_seconds": 264.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "The chest is clear and your oxygen level is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.91,
      "end_seconds": 280.47,
      "duration_seconds": 10.56,
      "text": "Please sit back down. So, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like a lingering cough after a viral infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.57,
      "end_seconds": 283.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.22,
      "end_seconds": 302.06,
      "duration_seconds": 17.84,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a lingering cough after a viral infection, and we'll know more once the a breathing test is back. I think a breathing test makes sense here, for breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.62,
      "end_seconds": 303.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.02,
      "end_seconds": 338.25,
      "duration_seconds": 32.23,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a chest X-ray for persistent cough. We'll begin with salbutamol inhaler, 100 micrograms, two puffs when needed, for two weeks. That's for wheeze and cough. Honey and lemon in warm water can ease it, and avoid smoky rooms. Keep an eye out, and if you cough up blood or get breathless at rest, call us the same day or go to emergency. We'll catch up in three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 339.77,
      "end_seconds": 341.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 342.6,
      "end_seconds": 346.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.16,
      "end_seconds": 353.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.45,
      "end_seconds": 356.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Have a good day."
    }
  ]
}